        "created_at": "2012-04-19T03:26:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, with that vague answer, I’m gonna take a guess and say that you’re all right about Chrono-Ranger and Visionary (promo) being in the same expansion, since CR is most likely from the same future that Visionary is from. And since I can kinda recall that Visionary ran away because the world went to hell, maybe CR was running from something too. Basically, without them, the world is doomed. But who would the other promo be for what I’m assuming is TIme &amp; Space? Assuming that each expansion has probably two promos for core heroes.</p>",
